                                "sense_id": "57b534be-c024-3ff8-8fd2-fd0428d55d6d",
                                "text": "[…] a piece of meat to which Mr. Jackdaw had helped himself, and which he was holding firmly down with one foot whilst he pecked away at it after the dawish fashion […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5edc12e-d920-4db5-9d4e-36c850110367",
                                "sense_id": "57b534be-c024-3ff8-8fd2-fd0428d55d6d",
                                "text": "An officer! A dawish fool, forsooth,\nHis class——denial of God in man; in truth\nI've scarce the time for pity,—none for ruth.\nGo marry then your Soldier!"
                            }
